</span><span class="tv-tok tv-c4">   </span><span class="tv-tok tv-c5"> static</span><span class="tv-tok tv-c6"> long</span><span class="tv-tok tv-c7"> fib</span><span class="tv-tok tv-c8">(long</span><span class="tv-tok tv-c9"> n</span><span class="tv-tok tv-c10">)</span><span class="tv-tok tv-c11"> {&#x21B5;
